---
title: "Contact — UOA Legal"
description: "Schedule a consultation with UOA Legal in Frisco, Texas — business, compliance, litigation, and immigration strategy."
layout: layouts/base.njk
navCurrent: contact
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow on-dark">Get Started</p>
    <h1>Your next move is a conversation.</h1>
    <hr class="gold-rule" />
    <p class="lede">High-stakes legal matters don't get easier with time. If you're navigating a business dispute, a compliance exposure, a federal agency, or a complex legal path — the sooner you have the right counsel, the more options you have.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-info">
        <p class="serif contact-lead">The consultation is where strategy begins. Not after you've retained us — at the first conversation.</p>
        <p>Tell us about your matter. We'll tell you honestly whether we're the right firm for it — and if we are, how we'd approach it.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:32px;">
          {% for office in site.offices %}
          <div class="contact-detail"><strong>{{ office.label }}</strong>{% for line in office.lines %}{{ line }}{% if not loop.last %}<br />{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
          {% endfor %}
          <div class="contact-detail"><strong>Phone</strong><a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></div>
          <div class="contact-detail"><strong>Email</strong><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Schedule a Consultation</p>

        <!-- TODO: replace YOUR_FORM_ID (see src/_data/site.js `formspreeId`) before go-live. -->
        <form class="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/{{ site.formspreeId }}" method="POST">
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="phone">Phone</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">How can we help?</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-dark" style="width:100%;">Schedule a Consultation</button>
          <p class="form-note">Prefer to talk directly? Call or email using the details at left.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
